---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';

const meta = {
  title: "Hufu · Chinese input for macOS",
  description: "Hufu, the input method for the AI era. An open-source, private macOS input method built on RIME.",
};
---

<Base locale="en" slug="" title={meta.title} description={meta.description} application>
  <main id="main"><section class="hero wrap"><h1>New words, <br class="hero-break">freely yours.</h1><p class="hero-sub">A macOS input method for Tiger-Code only. Open source, private, built on librime.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/en/download/">Install &amp; download <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><a class="button secondary" href="/en/docs/">Documentation</a></div><p class="release-note"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="nowrap">macOS 15.0+ · 0.1.0 available</span> <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <span class="nowrap">Unsigned, right-click to open</span></p></section><section class="stage-section" aria-labelledby="stage-caption"><div class="stage wrap"><div class="theme-stage theme-render-stage"><img src="/themes/renders/hufu_light-linear.png" width="524" height="47" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu candidate window: Tiger-Code huma, candidates 虎码 / 虎符 / 虎"><img src="/themes/renders/hufu_dark-linear.png" width="524" height="47" loading="lazy" alt="" hidden></div><p class="theme-note">Rendered by the App · Tiger-Code huma → 虎码</p></div></section><div class="home-sections wrap"><section class="feature-section feature-split" data-track-area="home-snippets" aria-labelledby="snippets-heading"><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="snippets-heading">IDs, numbers and addresses. One key.</h2><p>Keep phone numbers, email and addresses in categories. While typing, hold ⌥ and press 1. Press A, S or D to insert.</p></div><div class="snippet-demo" data-snippet-demo><div class="snippet-scene"><p class="snippet-message">Could you leave your phone number and email?</p><div class="ime-panel snippet-panel" data-view="phrases" style="--corner-radius:10px;--hilited-corner-radius:6px;--border-width:7px;--border-height:6px;--spacing:8px;--line-spacing:4px;--font-point:17px;--label-font-point:13px;--comment-font-point:13px;--ime-text-font:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, sans-serif;--ime-label-font:&quot;SF Pro Rounded&quot;, -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, sans-serif"><ol class="ime-tabs" aria-label="Snippet categories"><li class="on"><button type="button" data-snippet-tab="0" aria-pressed="true"><b>1</b>Phone</button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-tab="1" aria-pressed="false"><b>2</b>Email</button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-tab="2" aria-pressed="false"><b>3</b>Address</button></li></ol><ol class="ime-list ime-cells" data-snippet-list="0" aria-label="Phone"><li class="on"><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="A" data-value="+852 6100 6100"><b>A</b><span>+852 6100 6100</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="S" data-value="+86 139 1234 5678"><b>S</b><span>+86 139 1234 5678</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="D" data-value="+1 (415) 555-0100"><b>D</b><span>+1 (415) 555-0100</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li></ol><ol class="ime-list ime-cells" data-snippet-list="1" aria-label="Email" hidden><li class="on"><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="A" data-value="hello@example.com"><b>A</b><span>hello@example.com</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="S" data-value="luolei@work.example"><b>S</b><span>luolei@work.example</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="D" data-value="me@personal.example"><b>D</b><span>me@personal.example</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li></ol><ol class="ime-list ime-cells" data-snippet-list="2" aria-label="Address" hidden><li class="on"><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="A" data-value="香港中环皇后大道中 99 号"><b>A</b><span>香港中环皇后大道中 99 号</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="S" data-value="成都市锦江区春熙路 1 号"><b>S</b><span>成都市锦江区春熙路 1 号</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li></ol><p class="ime-hint">Letters insert · Numbers switch categories · ↑↓ move</p></div><div class="inputbar snippet-input"><p class="field" tabindex="0" role="textbox" aria-readonly="true" aria-label="Snippet input preview"><span data-snippet-output></span><span class="caret"></span></p><span class="ib-send" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 18V6M7 11l5-5 5 5"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class="preview-caption"><span>Interactive preview · Example data</span><button type="button" class="text-button" data-snippet-play aria-pressed="true" data-play="Play demo" data-pause="Pause demo">Pause demo</button><button type="button" class="text-button" data-snippet-reset>Reset</button></div><p class="sr-only" data-snippet-status aria-live="polite"></p></div></section><section class="feature-section feature-centered" data-track-area="home-themes" aria-labelledby="themes-heading"><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="themes-heading">Explore palettes. Make them your own.</h2><p>Pick a theme here, then click to import it into Hufu Settings.</p></div><div class="home-theme-widget" data-home-themes><div class="home-theme-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Candidate themes"><button type="button" data-home-theme="hufu_light" data-name="Hufu Light" aria-pressed="true">Hufu Light</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="hufu_dark" data-name="Hufu Dark" aria-pressed="false">Hufu Dark</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="graphite" data-name="Graphite" aria-pressed="false">Graphite</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="midnight" data-name="Midnight" aria-pressed="false">Midnight</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="sakura" data-name="Sakura" aria-pressed="false">Sakura</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="matcha" data-name="Matcha" aria-pressed="false">Matcha</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="nord" data-name="Nord" aria-pressed="false">Nord</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="paper" data-name="Paper" aria-pressed="false">Paper</button></div><div class="home-theme-layout" role="group" aria-label="Candidate layout"><button type="button" data-home-layout="linear" aria-pressed="true">Horizontal</button><button type="button" data-home-layout="stacked" aria-pressed="false">Vertical</button></div><div class="home-theme-pair"><div class="home-theme-desktop desktop-light"><img data-home-render src="/themes/renders/hufu_light-linear.png" width="524" height="47" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu Light · Horizontal candidate panel"><span>Light desktop</span></div><div class="home-theme-desktop desktop-dark"><img data-home-render src="/themes/renders/hufu_light-linear.png" width="524" height="47" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu Light · Horizontal candidate panel"><span>Dark desktop</span></div></div><p class="preview-caption">Rendered by the App</p><a class="theme-museum-entry" href="/en/themes/"><span class="theme-museum-mark"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m3 8 9-5 9 5H3Zm2 3v7m5-7v7m4-7v7m5-7v7M3 21h18M4 18h16"></path></svg></span><span class="theme-museum-label">Theme Museum</span><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class="feature-section feature-centered" data-track-area="home-stats" aria-labelledby="stats-heading"><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="stats-heading">A year of typing, counted.</h2><p>Character counts, active hours, your most-used apps and words. Stored on this Mac. Clear them at any time.</p><p class="section-note">Off by default. Counting starts when you enable it.</p></div><figure class="feature-figure stats-figure"><div class="feature-window"><img class="screenshot-light" src="/screenshots/settings/stats-light.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu typing statistics settings window"><img class="screenshot-dark" src="/screenshots/settings/stats-dark.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu typing statistics settings window"></div><figcaption>App screenshot · Example data</figcaption></figure></section><section class="feature-section feature-split apps-section" data-track-area="home-apps" aria-labelledby="apps-heading"><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="apps-heading">English in Terminal. Chinese in WeChat.</h2><p>Each app remembers its input state. On first launch, Hufu scans your installed apps and suggests defaults.</p></div><figure class="feature-figure"><div class="feature-window apps-crop"><img class="screenshot-light" src="/screenshots/settings/apps-light.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu per-app language settings, upper portion"><img class="screenshot-dark" src="/screenshots/settings/apps-dark.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu per-app language settings, upper portion"></div><figcaption>App screenshot</figcaption></figure></section><section class="feature-section feature-split ai-section" data-track-area="home-ai" aria-labelledby="ai-heading"><div class="ai-scene"><div class="ai-note"><div class="ai-note-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>Notes</span></div><p class="ai-document">Reply to Lena<br><mark>我想去吃潮州菜，七点在中环见？</mark><span class="caret"></span></p></div><div class="ime-panel ring ai-results" data-view="result" style="--corner-radius:10px;--hilited-corner-radius:6px;--border-width:7px;--border-height:6px;--spacing:8px;--line-spacing:4px;--font-point:17px;--label-font-point:13px;--comment-font-point:13px;--ime-text-font:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, sans-serif;--ime-label-font:&quot;SF Pro Rounded&quot;, -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, sans-serif"><ol class="ime-list ime-results"><li class="on"><b>1</b><span class="ime-out"><em>Translate</em>How about Chiuchow food tonight? Meet in Central at 7?</span></li><li><b>2</b><span class="ime-out"><em>Polish</em>今晚去吃潮州菜吧，七点在中环见，可以吗？</span></li><li><b>3</b><span class="ime-out"><em>Cantonese</em>今晚去食潮州嘢，七點喺中環見？</span></li></ol></div><p class="preview-caption">Example results · No network request</p></div><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="ai-heading">Translate and polish <br>at the cursor.</h2><p>Select a passage, then press ⌃⌥P or hold ⌥ and choose AI from the quick menu. Only that selection is processed.</p></div></section><section class="feature-section settings-pair" data-track-area="home-settings" aria-label="Appearance and vocabulary"><article><h2><span class="settings-title-line">See colors, type size and corners as you edit.</span></h2><figure class="feature-figure"><div class="feature-window"><img class="screenshot-light" src="/screenshots/settings/appearance-light.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="外观设置窗口"><img class="screenshot-dark" src="/screenshots/settings/appearance-dark.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="外观设置窗口"></div><figcaption>App screenshot</figcaption></figure></article><article><h2><span class="settings-title-line">Single characters first. Words when you want them.</span></h2><figure class="feature-figure"><div class="feature-window"><img class="screenshot-light" src="/screenshots/settings/dictionaries-light.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="词库设置窗口"><img class="screenshot-dark" src="/screenshots/settings/dictionaries-dark.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="词库设置窗口"></div><figcaption>App screenshot</figcaption></figure></article></section></div><script type="module" src="/assets/home-sections.js" is:inline></script><section class="features wrap" aria-label="Highlights"><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m9 7-5 5 5 5m6-10 5 5-5 5"></path></svg></span><h2>Built on RIME. Open source.</h2><p>Tiger-Code only, built on librime. Reads existing RIME configuration and imports vocabulary, phrases and colour schemes from Squirrel.</p><p class="feature-proof">Original code MIT · dependencies keep their licences</p><a class="text-link feature-link" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu">GitHub · syhily/hufu <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M7 11V8a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3M6 11h12v9H6Z"></path></svg></span><h2>Everyday typing stays on your Mac.</h2><p>Composition, candidates and personal word frequency stay on your Mac. No telemetry. Snippets stay local. Typing statistics are off by default.</p><p class="feature-proof">AI defaults to Apple’s on-device model, which depends on your device, system settings and region (currently unavailable for mainland China devices and accounts). Otherwise, configure your own OpenAI-compatible endpoint (may be billed).</p><a class="text-link feature-link" href="/en/privacy/">Privacy details <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 4l1.8 4.2L16 10l-4.2 1.8L10 16l-1.8-4.2L4 10l4.2-1.8ZM18 14l.9 2.1L21 17l-2.1.9L18 20l-.9-2.1L15 17l2.1-.9Z"></path></svg></span><h2>Call AI when you need it.</h2><p>Press ⌃⌥P, or hold ⌥ and choose AI from the quick menu, to translate or polish the text you choose. Add your own actions too.</p><p class="feature-proof">Simplified/Traditional conversion runs locally and needs no AI.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13 3 5 13.5h6L10 21l8-10.5h-6Z"></path></svg></span><h2>Use keys for frequent text.</h2><p>Uses native librime. Organize snippets and assign phrase codes. Pick symbols with letter keys. Frequent words appear first.</p><p class="feature-proof">librime linked statically · word tables prebuilt · first deploy about 1 second</p></article></section><section class="cta-band wrap" aria-labelledby="cta-heading"><h2 id="cta-heading">Install it. Try a few words.</h2><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/en/download/">Install &amp; download <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><a class="button secondary" href="/en/docs/">Documentation</a></div></section><script type="module" src="/assets/home.js" is:inline></script></main>
</Base>
